<title>UK: CSFB sets call warrants on Swiss Re.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets call warrants on Swiss Re.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston says it has issued four million American-style call warrants, on Swiss Re registered shares.</p>
<p>50 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,700.00 CHF	    PREMIUM	14.35 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.62 CHF		  GEARING	9.09 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 07.MAY.97-29.JAN.99   PAYDATE	06.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1,645.00 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	     </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
